{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-from-centralized","title":"从集中式数据平台迁移到数据网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/adoption/migration-from-centralized","wordCount":1121,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"从集中式数据平台迁移到数据网格\">从集中式数据平台迁移到数据网格</h1><p>迁移是数据网格实践中最复杂的工程挑战之一。大多数组织不是从零开始建设数据网格，而是需要在已有的集中式数据仓库、数据湖或 Lakehouse 架构基础上进行渐进式迁移。本文讲解如何以最低风险完成这一过渡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移的核心原则\">迁移的核心原则</h2><p><strong>渐进式</strong>：不做大爆炸式迁移，逐个领域、逐个数据产品地迁移。</p>\n<p><strong>双轨并行</strong>：迁移期间旧系统和新数据产品并存，消费者逐步切换。</p>\n<p><strong>价值驱动</strong>：优先迁移高价值、高痛点的数据域，用成功案例建立信心。</p>\n<p><strong>不破坏稳定</strong>：迁移过程中，下游消费者不应感受到服务中断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"strangler-fig-模式\">Strangler Fig 模式</h2><p>Strangler Fig 模式（马丁·福勒提出）是微服务迁移的经典策略，同样适用于数据网格迁移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Strangler Fig 迁移模式&#10;&#10;阶段 1：初始状态&#10;┌───────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│          集中式数据湖/数仓          │&#10;│   全部领域数据 → 中央 ETL → 数仓    │&#10;└───────────────────────────────────┘&#10;         ↑ 所有消费者读取&#10;&#10;阶段 2：第一个领域迁移（Order Domain）&#10;┌─────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│ Order Data Product (新)             │&#10;│   order-service → Flink → Kafka/BQ  │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────┘&#10;         ↑ 新消费者读取（分析/ML）&#10;┌───────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│          集中式数据湖/数仓          │&#10;│   依然包含 Order 数据（旧路径）      │&#10;└───────────────────────────────────┘&#10;         ↑ 旧消费者继续读取&#10;&#10;阶段 3：切换完成&#10;┌─────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│ Order Data Product                  │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────┘&#10;         ↑ 所有消费者已迁移&#10;┌───────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│   集中式数仓（不再包含 Order 数据） │&#10;└───────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Strangler Fig 迁移模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 1：初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌───────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│          集中式数据湖/数仓          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   全部领域数据 → 中央 ETL → 数仓    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└───────────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↑ 所有消费者读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 2：第一个领域迁移（Order Domain）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Order Data Product (新)             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   order-service → Flink → Kafka/BQ  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↑ 新消费者读取（分析/ML）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌───────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│          集中式数据湖/数仓          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   依然包含 Order 数据（旧路径）      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└───────────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↑ 旧消费者继续读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>阶段 3：切换完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Order Data Product                  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↑ 所有消费者已迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌───────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   集中式数仓（不再包含 Order 数据） │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└───────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"双写阶段-dual-write-phase\">双写阶段（Dual-Write Phase）</h2><p>双写是保障迁移安全的核心技术手段：在迁移期间，数据同时写入旧系统和新数据产品，直到消费者完全切换到新路径才停止旧路径的写入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"双写实现策略\">双写实现策略</h3><p><strong>策略一：CDC + 旧 ETL 并行</strong></p>\n<p>最简单的双写方案：旧 ETL 继续运行写入数仓，同时新的 CDC 管道并行运行写入数据产品。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"PostgreSQL (Order DB)&#10;     │&#10;     ├──→ (旧路径) Airbyte ETL ──→ BigQuery 数仓 orders 表&#10;     │                               ↑ 旧消费者（BI 报表）&#10;     │&#10;     └──→ (新路径) Debezium CDC ──→ Flink ──→ order.events.v2&#10;                                               ↑ 新消费者（ML/流处理）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PostgreSQL (Order DB)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     ├──→ (旧路径) Airbyte ETL ──→ BigQuery 数仓 orders 表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │                               ↑ 旧消费者（BI 报表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     └──→ (新路径) Debezium CDC ──→ Flink ──→ order.events.v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                               ↑ 新消费者（ML/流处理）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：数据产品反向写回数仓（用于消费者切换）</strong></p>\n<p>如果旧消费者的迁移成本较高，可以让新数据产品也向旧数仓写回，给旧消费者无缝过渡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"order.events.v2 (新数据产品)&#10;     │&#10;     ├──→ 新消费者直接消费（Kafka/BigQuery 原生接口）&#10;     │&#10;     └──→ (反向写回) 向旧数仓写入 orders_v2 视图&#10;               ↑ 旧消费者无需修改查询语句\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>order.events.v2 (新数据产品)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     ├──→ 新消费者直接消费（Kafka/BigQuery 原生接口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     └──→ (反向写回) 向旧数仓写入 orders_v2 视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               ↑ 旧消费者无需修改查询语句</span></span></code></pre></div><p>反向写回的实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# reverse_write_to_legacy.py&#10;# 数据产品 CI/CD 中自动运行，确保旧消费者不受影响&#10;&#10;def sync_to_legacy_warehouse():&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    将 order.events.v2 (BigQuery) 同步到旧数仓的兼容视图&#10;    目的：让旧消费者在不修改 SQL 的情况下完成迁移&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 在旧数仓中创建指向新数据产品的外部表或物化视图&#10;    bq_client = bigquery.Client()&#10;&#10;    legacy_view_sql = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW legacy_warehouse.orders_v2 AS&#10;    SELECT&#10;        order_id,&#10;        customer_id AS user_id,          -- 字段名兼容&#10;        event_time AS updated_at,        -- 字段名兼容&#10;        event_type,&#10;        total_amount,&#10;        -- 重建旧格式的 status 字段（从事件流反推）&#10;        LAST_VALUE(&#10;            CASE event_type&#10;                WHEN &#39;ORDER_CREATED&#39;   THEN &#39;created&#39;&#10;                WHEN &#39;ORDER_PAID&#39;      THEN &#39;paid&#39;&#10;                WHEN &#39;ORDER_SHIPPED&#39;   THEN &#39;shipped&#39;&#10;                WHEN &#39;ORDER_DELIVERED&#39; THEN &#39;delivered&#39;&#10;                WHEN &#39;ORDER_CANCELLED&#39; THEN &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;            END&#10;        ) OVER (&#10;            PARTITION BY order_id&#10;            ORDER BY event_time&#10;            ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING&#10;        ) AS status&#10;    FROM&#10;        `company-dw.order_domain.order_events_v2`&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    bq_client.query(legacy_view_sql).result()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># reverse_write_to_legacy.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据产品 CI/CD 中自动运行，确保旧消费者不受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sync_to_legacy_warehouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    将 order.events.v2 (BigQuery) 同步到旧数仓的兼容视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    目的：让旧消费者在不修改 SQL 的情况下完成迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 在旧数仓中创建指向新数据产品的外部表或物化视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bq_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bigquery.Client()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    legacy_view_sql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW legacy_warehouse.orders_v2 AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        customer_id AS user_id,          -- 字段名兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_time AS updated_at,        -- 字段名兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        -- 重建旧格式的 status 字段（从事件流反推）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LAST_VALUE(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            CASE event_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                WHEN 'ORDER_CREATED'   THEN 'created'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                WHEN 'ORDER_PAID'      THEN 'paid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                WHEN 'ORDER_SHIPPED'   THEN 'shipped'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                WHEN 'ORDER_DELIVERED' THEN 'delivered'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                WHEN 'ORDER_CANCELLED' THEN 'cancelled'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            PARTITION BY order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            ORDER BY event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ) AS status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        `company-dw.order_domain.order_events_v2`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bq_client.query(legacy_view_sql).result()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消费者迁移管理\">消费者迁移管理</h2><h3 id=\"消费者清单与迁移状态追踪\">消费者清单与迁移状态追踪</h3><p>在开始迁移前，先建立完整的消费者清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# migration/order-domain/consumer-registry.yaml&#10;dataProduct: order-events&#10;version: v2&#10;migration_deadline: &#39;2026-12-31&#39;&#10;&#10;consumers:&#10;  - name: &#39;BI 每日订单报表&#39;&#10;    team: &#39;analytics-team&#39;&#10;    current_source: &#39;legacy_warehouse.orders&#39;&#10;    target_source: &#39;order_domain.order_events_v2&#39;&#10;    migration_status: &#39;MIGRATED&#39;&#10;    migrated_at: &#39;2026-06-15&#39;&#10;    notes: &#39;已切换到 BigQuery 新数据集&#39;&#10;&#10;  - name: &#39;订单取消率 ML 特征&#39;&#10;    team: &#39;ml-team&#39;&#10;    current_source: &#39;legacy_warehouse.orders&#39;&#10;    target_source: &#39;kafka://order.events.v2&#39;&#10;    migration_status: &#39;IN_PROGRESS&#39;&#10;    started_at: &#39;2026-07-01&#39;&#10;    expected_completion: &#39;2026-08-15&#39;&#10;    blocker: &#39;需要修改 Flink 作业读取 Kafka 而非 BigQuery&#39;&#10;&#10;  - name: &#39;实时库存扣减服务&#39;&#10;    team: &#39;inventory-team&#39;&#10;    current_source: &#39;PostgreSQL CDC (直连)&#39;&#10;    target_source: &#39;kafka://order.events.v2&#39;&#10;    migration_status: &#39;NOT_STARTED&#39;&#10;    priority: &#39;LOW&#39;&#10;    notes: &#39;已有独立 CDC，非紧急迁移&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-lig